Now we have candidate_prepared shift_candidate_alpha.

Next, we need to assemble transport leg. There are several assemble actions; we need transport_leg_assembled etc. Since we have origin_availability_alpha and destination_availability_alpha (both are candidate_entity). We need to lock them etc.

