Now we also need to confirm origin_availability_confirmed and destination_availability_confirmed as part of lock effect (they become true). Good.

Now we need origin_node_ready and destination_node_ready. There are actions activate_origin_node and activate_destination_node.

Precondition for activate_origin_node:
- candidate_prepared ?origin_availability
- candidate_task_profile_linked ?origin_availability ?route_task_profile
- origin_availability_node_linked ?origin_availability ?origin_node
- not origin_node_ready ?origin_node
- not origin_node_occupied ?origin_node
Effect: origin_node_ready ?origin_node.

Thus we need candidate_prepared origin_availability_alpha (we have), candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (we have after attach before detach? Actually after we detach, candidate_task_profile_linked becomes false. So we need to have task profile linked at the time of activation. So we should activate before detaching the task profile.

