But note: assemble_transport_leg also requires origin_availability_node_linked and destination_availability_node_linked (we have from init). Good.

Thus after lock and activation, we can assemble.

Now we need to authorize transport leg loading: authorize_transport_leg_loading requires:
- transport_leg_assembled ?transport_leg
