Thus after we have transport_leg_assembled and loading authorized, we can load container onto leg using shift_candidate_alpha.

After that, we have loading_container_loaded and loading_container_leg_linked.

Now we need candidate_loading_verified shift_candidate_alpha. We can use verify_loading_profile_nominal (or destination_flag). Verify_loading_profile_nominal requires:
