- verify_loading_profile_nominal shift_candidate_alpha skill_certificate_alpha driver_operator_alpha loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha

But note: verify_loading_profile_nominal also requires candidate_operator_linked (we have after assign), candidate_skill_certificate_linked (after assign), candidate_loading_container_linked (we have), loading_container_leg_linked (after load), not destination_leg_loaded (we haven't loaded destination leg yet), not candidate_loading_verified.

Thus after verification, we get candidate_loading_verified.

Now we need to establish clearance: we can use establish_clearance_nominal (requires candidate_loading_verified, candidate_compliance_certificate_linked, candidate_loading_container_linked, loading_container_leg_linked, not origin_leg_loaded, not destination_leg_loaded, not candidate_clearance_established). We have candidate_loading_verified after verification. Need candidate_compliance_certificate_linked shift_candidate_alpha. We have compliance_certificate_alpha available initially; we can assign via assign_compliance_certificate (requires candidate_prepared, compliance_certificate_available). Effect: candidate_compliance_certificate_linked and not compliance_certificate_available.

We also need loading_container_leg_linked (we have after load). Not origin_leg_loaded and not destination_leg_loaded (we haven't loaded any leg yet). So we can establish clearance_nominal.

After that we have candidate_clearance_established and route_sequence_context_set.

Now we can finalize candidate via finalize_candidate_direct (requires candidate_clearance_established, not route_sequence_context_set, not candidate_finalized). Wait finalize_candidate_direct requires NOT route_sequence_context_set. But establish_clearance_nominal effect includes route_sequence_context_set. So after establishing clearance, route_sequence_context_set becomes true, which would violate the precondition of finalize_candidate_direct (which requires NOT route_sequence_context_set). So we cannot use finalize_candidate_direct after establishing clearance_nominal because it sets route_sequence_context_set.

